description = "A function and a macro in another file do not change the identity of the polymorphic show effect."
@ cases.check-alone
source = ```tauto
pub fn check(name: Text, ok: Bool): Unit ! {∀ A. show(A)} {
  if ok { perform show(name, "ok") } else { perform show(name, "FAILED") }
}
```
